* Two blocks of memory (made up for testing the debugger).
* The code is at >A000 and the text is in a separate block at >B000.
* Try it: debug it. The text TWO BLOCKS WORK should appear at the top left.
        DEF   START
        REF   VMBW
        AORG  >A000

START   LWPI  WS
        LIMI  0
        LI    R0,>0000          ; screen position 0 (top left)
        LI    R1,MSG            ; the text lives in the other block
        LI    R2,MSGEND-MSG
        BLWP  @VMBW
DONE    JMP   DONE              ; wait here
WS      BSS   32

        AORG  >B000
MSG     TEXT  'TWO BLOCKS WORK'
MSGEND  EVEN
        END   START
